<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61268" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (perh. cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖμαι, κοιμάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deep sleep</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτῷ . . μαλακὸν περὶ κῶμα κάλυψα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.359
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ με . . μαλακὸν περὶ κῶμ᾽ ἐκάλυψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.201
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸν δέ ἑ κῶμα καλύπτει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					798
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθυσσομένων δὲ φύλλων κ. κατάρρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνου κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					3.6
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of the effect of music, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>.—Not in Trag. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic., <i>lethargic state, coma</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμα συνεχές, οὐχ ὑπνῶδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					3.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.643
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				458
			</span></i>.</div>
